WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.466
Read the world. Understand the goal. Act with purpose.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:12.602
3A-VLA learns to align the goal with the scene, turning task-relevant abstractions into better action learning.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.365
At deployment, the policy acts directly.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.335
Sharper abstractions. Stronger results.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.155
Core skills, learned in Game for Peace.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.727
Carry that understanding into changing rooms, rivals, and worlds.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.123
Reach the vehicle, then take the wheel. Find a route, then keep moving.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.223
Different worlds. Shared intent.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.117
Abstraction. Alignment. Action.
